      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I don't understand example ex #3704 in the context of this grammar point...",
      "html": "I don't understand example ex #3704 in the context of this grammar point...",
      "credits_raw": "halx",
      "content_sha256": "15268979380fa9d0fbb9cfb38bf6b93f41e4bd657825c413605413c7dbbb4c5a",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I also don't see ex [#3704] as fitting this grammar structure. And, I don't know for sure about the JLPT level, but I learned this in an upper basic course which I would guess translates to JLPT 3.",
      "html": "I also don't see ex [#3704] as fitting this grammar structure. And, I don't know for sure about the JLPT level, but I learned this in an upper basic course which I would guess translates to JLPT 3.",
      "credits_raw": "yookoso",
      "content_sha256": "066bc729dc9f811ca11dfc7ddce12addf494e15f804e026050a54b03d557db25",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I have found references to this grammar topic in JLPT3 texts.",
      "html": "I have found references to this grammar topic in JLPT3 texts.",
      "credits_raw": "moomoochoo",
      "content_sha256": "9f289822a93c0ef74d4899cbc1bb74777a9bb13f8cf0f59d90a651c28cee41f1",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I agree with Amataka and Miki.\nことになる is just the になる grammar used with the verb nomilizer V-ruこと.",
      "html": "I agree with Amataka and Miki.<br/>ことになる is just the になる grammar used with the verb nomilizer V-ruこと.",
